# @ndb/logger Generated Types (read-only for AI)

Never create, modify, or delete `src/packages/logger/native.d.ts`. It is regenerated by NAPI-RS on build (`--dts native.d.ts`).

## Where to make changes instead

- **NAPI bindings**: edit Rust in `src/packages/logger/src/` and run the logger RS build.
- **JS entry glue**: edit `src/packages/logger/index.ts` to re-export native bindings. Annotate JS-only exports with types from `./native.d.ts`.
- **Package types**: edit `src/packages/logger/exports.d.ts` to re-export NAPI types from `native.d.ts` and JS-only values from `index.ts`; `package.json` `types` points here, `default` at `index.ts`.

## Allowed

- Read `native.d.ts` to understand generated NAPI types.

## Not allowed

- Hand-editing `native.d.ts` to add exports like `ray`
